title: Birthday
---
The cottage glows with candlelight. Mother has baked a honey cake, and Ros is bouncing on her toes. #line:bday_001
Ros: Did you get me something? Did you, did you? #line:bday_002
-> Give Ros her gift. #line:bday_opt_give
    <<set_flag gift_given>>
    <<take_item honey sweets|cornflower ribbon|carved wooden bird>>
    Ros squeals and throws her arms around you. #line:bday_ack_give_0
    Ros: It's perfect! You're the best! #line:bday_ack_give
-> Keep the gift for yourself. #line:bday_opt_keep
    <<set_flag gift_kept>>
    Ros's face falls. She says nothing, but she doesn't look at you for the rest of supper. #line:bday_ack_keep
Later, as the candles gutter, Father goes to the window and goes very still. #line:bday_smoke
There is smoke rising from the woods. #line:bday_smoke_2
Father: Charcoal burners, most likely. Off to bed, the both of you. #line:bday_father_bed
-> Go to bed. #line:bday_opt_bed
    You lie awake a long time, listening to Father's boots creak by the door. #line:bday_ack_bed
-> Ask Father what's wrong. #line:bday_opt_ask
    Father: Nothing for you to worry about. Bed. Now. #line:bday_ack_ask
    You lie awake a long time, listening to his boots creak by the door. #line:bday_ack_ask_2
===
